    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.ixion.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.ixion.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:ixion"><head>ΙΞΙΩΝ</head>
          <pb n="597" facs="urn:hathi:iau.31858007086675:scan:605"/>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="82" xml:id="frag_76fe1b9608" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.ixion.nauck1889-grc1:90">
<note type="source">Stobæus CXXI, 16. Αἰσχύλου Ἰξίονος.</note>
<lg type="fragment">
<l n="1" xml:id="frag_76fe1b9608-l1" xml:lang="grc">Βίου πονηροῦ θάνατος εὐκλεέστερος.</l>
</lg>
</div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="83" xml:id="frag_4d4a1d9408" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.ixion.nauck1889-grc1:93">
<note type="source">Hesychius, Ἱερῖτιν: καθαρμοῦ δεομένην, ἱκέτιν. Αἰσχύλος Ἰξίονι. Codex ἱερείτην.</note>
</div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="84" xml:id="frag_009b0f55a2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:ixion">
<note type="source">Scholiasta Pindari Pyth. ΙΙ, 39. Τὸν Ἰξίονα οἱ μὲν Ἀντίονος γενεαλογοῦσιν, ὡς Αἰσχύλος.</note>
</div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="85" xml:id="frag_cd656939fe" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:ixion" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.ixion.nauck1889-grc1:91">
<note type="source">Athenæus IV. p. 182 c. Οἴδαμεν δὲ καὶ τοὺς ἡμιόπους (αὐλοὺς) καλουμένους. εἰσὶ δ᾽ οἱ αὐλοὶ οὗτοι ἐλάσσονες τῶν τελείων. Αἰσχύλος γοῦν κατὰ μεταφορὰν ἐν Ἰξίονί φησι</note>
<lg type="fragment">
<l n="1" xml:id="frag_cd656939fe-l1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸν δ᾽ ἡμίοπον καὶ τὸν ἐλάσσονα</l>
<l n="2" xml:id="frag_cd656939fe-l2" xml:lang="grc">ταχέως ὁ μέγας καταπίνει.</l>
</lg>
<note type="commentary">καὶ τὸν ἐλάσσω Porsonus. Hæc verba delet Bothius. ἡμίοπον αὐλὸν ex Æschylo memorat Pollux VI, 161.</note>
</div>
        </div></body></text>
